{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And the priest.</b> This is Jethro, not Reuel. And every \"priest\" in Scripture is one who serves [either] HaShem or idolatry. The proof: וכהנו לי (Exodus 28:1) and כהני ד׳ (Isaiah 61:6). Jethro was a priest of HaShem, as I will yet explain."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:31:03.539345161Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}